o-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.0000pt 842.0000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>2026年4月23日晚7时，机械工程学院于机械大楼318会议室召开23级本科生班长、团支书交流座谈会。院党委副书记李晓杰、刘辅导员晨华老师及各班班长、团支书参会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8L4liboR9sUmnkLDR9in774MRnfMlUs4nzvYnRn7M8CPLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPMYyboky8L8n7LmN8MmfRnmVfU4v8LzvYnz-8LNnVL4AFLmvDMlQRnzfFLz-inz-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8MmCsgtA8pUZcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34667&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4179843DD29460CF1AC74172E242DE38/2765FCE0/125E2\" vheight=\"284\" vwidth=\"378\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8L4liboR9sUmnkLDR9in774MRnfMlUs4nzvYnRn7M8CPLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPMYyboky8L8n7LmN8MmfRnmVfU4v8LzvYnz-8LNnVL4AFLmvDMlQRnzfFLz-inz-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8MmCsgtA8pUZcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34667&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>会议聚焦考研就业与学风建设。李晓杰副书记指出，要借鉴往届经验，提升升学率与就业质量。各班班长、团支书依次围绕升学计划、就业打算、课堂情况反映问题，老师逐一解答指导，现场气氛坦诚热烈。最后李晓杰副书记总结强调：考研已成大势，要重视成绩、加强专业课学习，提升科研能力，丰富竞赛经历；班团干部应多组织经验交流会，坚定班级同学备考决心。面对严峻就业形势，同学们要认清现状、积极应对，灵活就业。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8olWiVnlWRLNU8LDzrknNlZL7M2ozfs2oRrfoRfkLmUsU4l0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysM1yiMSyaLNrVMmVkUln7oz78M4-YnN-iLzLinR9snzTFnlMfM4L4Lz6FUmWfLSbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g478L490L4UDMmvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34667&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9765502EE61BADD914722FB5135D87E9/ECA73317/B2A1\" vheight=\"252\" vwidth=\"378\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8olWiVnlWRLNU8LDzrknNlZL7M2ozfs2oRrfoRfkLmUsU4l0gihFp2hmCIa0oSysM1yiMSyaLNrVMmVkUln7oz78M4-YnN-iLzLinR9snzTFnlMfM4L4Lz6FUmWfLSbaptveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g478L490L4UDMmvJqdZnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34667&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>本次座谈会明确了备考与择业目标，缓解大三学生发展焦虑，同时聚焦课堂出勤率，强化纪律要求，以严纪律促优学风，营造踏实专注的学习氛围。</p><p>一审一校/石秋骏</p><p>二审二校/王浩然</p><p>三审三校/李宗霖</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=8L4liboR9sUmnkLDR9in774MRnfMlUs4nzvYnRn7M8CPLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPMYyboky8L8n7LmN8MmfRnmVfU4v8LzvYnz-8LNnVL4AFLmvDMlQRnzfFLz-inz-Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L8MmCsgtA8pUZcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=34667&e=.png"}